// NOTE (2026-09-03 switched to ATR-mult stops): the fixed-pip SL/TP this file used to carry
// went through two rounds of manual rescaling (FX pip counts, then a "~25x for gold" guess) and
// STILL blew the account on a real GC1! 1-min run: the guess assumed pip_size ~0.01, but that run
// was actually configured with pip_size=1.0, so the 500/1000 "pip" SL/TP resolved to a $500/$1000
// stop/target on an instrument trading in the low thousands -- a 20%+ per-trade risk that
// triggered the account-survivability floor almost immediately (see the Full Pipeline batch log,
// "Account BLOWN" + "fixed-pips stop ... implausible fraction of price" warnings). A fixed pip
// count is fundamentally fragile: it's only ever correct for the one pip_size/instrument it was
// tuned at. Switched to T58_SL_ATR_MULT/T58_TP_ATR_MULT below instead -- these compute the
// stop/target as a multiple of the instrument's OWN actual ATR at backtest time, in raw price
// units, so they're correct on gold, an FX pair, an index, or crypto without ever touching
// pip_size at all. See app/strategy/pinescript.py's module docstring for how these are parsed.
//@version=5
strategy("T58 Trend Pullback")

fastLen = input.int(20, "Fast EMA")
slowLen = input.int(50, "Slow EMA")
rsiLen = input.int(14, "RSI Length")
rsiLongMin = input.float(50.0, "Long RSI Minimum")
rsiLongMax = input.float(68.0, "Long RSI Maximum")
rsiShortMin = input.float(32.0, "Short RSI Minimum")
rsiShortMax = input.float(50.0, "Short RSI Maximum")

fastEMA = ta.ema(close, fastLen)
slowEMA = ta.ema(close, slowLen)
rsiVal = ta.rsi(close, rsiLen)

longTrend = fastEMA > slowEMA
shortTrend = fastEMA < slowEMA

longPullback = low < fastEMA and close > fastEMA
shortPullback = high > fastEMA and close < fastEMA

longMomentum = rsiVal > rsiLongMin and rsiVal < rsiLongMax
shortMomentum = rsiVal > rsiShortMin and rsiVal < rsiShortMax

longCondition = longTrend and longPullback and longMomentum and close > open
shortCondition = shortTrend and shortPullback and shortMomentum and close < open

exitLongCondition = ta.crossunder(close, fastEMA)
exitShortCondition = ta.crossover(close, fastEMA)

strategy.entry("Long", strategy.long, when=longCondition)
strategy.entry("Short", strategy.short, when=shortCondition)

strategy.close("Long", when=exitLongCondition)
strategy.close("Short", when=exitShortCondition)

// T58_SL_ATR_MULT=1.5
// T58_TP_ATR_MULT=2.5
// T58_ATR_PERIOD=14
